/// M09 CORE-030 "markdown render: roots green, nine assert roots".
/// Source: tests/integration/markdown_test.go symbol
/// TestCurrentMarkdownRender (L34-126).
/// Related fixture: compiler/testdata/current/markdown/main.can (read at
/// L47, staged as src/main.can at L55); every count pin below grounds an
/// assert arm in that fixture (emit 1, raw 2, page 2, served 1, main 3;
/// total 9).
/// Disposition: RETAIN (migrate row; the old Go harness stays until the
/// integrator retires it after every linked row, variant, environment and
/// control has accepted evidence).
/// Protects (this file): canlc assert green with a passed report carrying
/// exactly 9 roots, grounded per function in the markdown fixture.
/// ADAPTATION (recorded, with source lines): TestCurrentMarkdownRender
/// drives the assert leg at L60-63 (status 0 and empty diagnostics or the
/// test fatals) but, unlike the crypto row, carries no explicit report
/// passed/len legs, so report-passed pins the passed report entailed by
/// that green assert and root-count pins the 9 fixture assert arms as the
/// P23 qualification baseline; no execution is claimed here (accept_after
/// P23 unmet).
/// Live render outputs, usage text and the negative mutations live in
/// core-030-markdown-semantics.can; the production process shape lives in
/// core-030-run-shape.can.
/// Variants: none in this file (default only); heading, raw script, the
/// three usage legs and the two negative source mutations live in the
/// markdown-semantics file.
/// Environment: CAN_BUN_ARCHIVE + macOS sandbox-exec; requires
/// can-bun-archive, macos-sandbox-exec. Logical gates SUITE/WORK/PROC/N1
/// and C/R/N/S/A identities bind at P23; no live run now. Descriptor
/// timeout 360000ms mirrors the Go 6-minute ctx (L41).
/// Delegated oracles: none.
/// Execution credit: NOT claimed (accept_after P23 unmet).
/// Case markdown/render-roots checks: assert-green, report-passed,
/// root-count, fixture-name, emit-roots, raw-roots, page-roots,
/// served-roots, main-roots.
/// Facet map (markdown_test.go legs plus fixture arms): assert-green pins
/// the assert leg (L60-63: status 0 and empty diagnostics or the test
/// fatals); report-passed pins the passed report entailed by that green
/// assert (no explicit Go leg; P23 baseline); root-count pins the nine
/// roots (1 + 2 + 2 + 1 + 3 across the fixture asserts blocks);
/// fixture-name grounds the pins in the staged fixture (L47: markdown
/// main.can; L55: src/main.can); emit-roots pins emit (fixture L9:
/// sample "hi" => ok 2, 1 root); raw-roots pins raw (fixture L25-26:
/// sample/hostile, 2 roots); page-roots pins page (fixture L33-34:
/// sample/bad_link, 2 roots); served-roots pins served (fixture L39:
/// sample => ok true, 1 root); main-roots pins main (fixture L53-55:
/// empty/badop/arity => ok, 3 roots).
/// Shared old files untouched; retirement is a later integrator decision.
record context
